  m_text: 'Appearance: Skin is dry, stiff, leathery, and may be white, dark brown,
    or charred black.

    Sensation: Little to no pain in the immediate area, though
    surrounding areas may have 1st or 2nd-degree burns that are extremely painful.

    Swelling:
    The affected area often swells rapidly'
